  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "service",
      "title": "Initial activation and ordinary reset",
      "items": [
        "Initial Authenticate associates the device identity; TokenUpdate enables the channel. Same-certificate Authenticate retries preserve the existing enrollment, tokens, queue and declarative state.",
        "Both service.Core and the reference server deny changed certificates by default. An explicitly allowed changed-identity Authenticate resets enrollment state; the reset arrows show that path.",
        "A rejected request preserves the existing state. A disabled enrollment cannot reactivate with its old certificate or TokenUpdate; a fresh identity requires authorized re-enrollment."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "service",
      "title": "Controlled profile replacement",
      "items": [
        "An authorized replacement retains the active identity while collecting the candidate’s Authenticate, device TokenUpdate, and InstallProfile acknowledgement.",
        "Only successful completion promotes the candidate atomically. Failed, cancelled, and expired attempts keep the working enrollment, queue, escrow, and user channels."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "neutral",
      "title": "Checkout and user channels",
      "items": [
        "CheckOut disables the enrollment and clears dependent state while retaining its record. A fresh identity can reactivate it only through authorized re-enrollment. Declarative cleanup runs through the service hook.",
        "User channels are created by TokenUpdate under an existing device enrollment, with UserAuthenticate when required. They do not send device-channel Authenticate."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "transport",
      "title": "Public documentation",
      "items": [
        "Check-in — https://developer.apple.com/documentation/devicemanagement/check-in",
        "Deploying device management enrollment profiles — https://developer.apple.com/documentation/devicemanagement/deploying-device-management-enrollment-profiles",
        "MDM payload — https://developer.apple.com/documentation/devicemanagement/mdm",
        "Implementation — https://github.com/deploymenttheory/go-apple-dm/blob/7500eb25e50a2913338339d5fced18dc7f41fdc3/server/service/checkin.go"
      ]
    }
